### from_tgas

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl from_tgas\n    (tgas : i32)\n    : gas\n    =\n    backend_switch {\n        // Native literals are typed (`300i32`); from_tgas takes a u64.\n        Rust = fun () => !\\($'\"near_workspaces::types::Gas::from_tgas(!tgas as u64)\"') : gas\n    }","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl from_tgas
      (tgas : i32)
      : gas
      =
      backend_switch {
          // Native literals are typed (`300i32`); from_tgas takes a u64.
          Rust = fun () => !\($'"near_workspaces::types::Gas::from_tgas(!tgas as u64)"') : gas
      }
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

